/IF LETTER, RETURNS TO RET+1 WITH LETTER-"A IN AC AND LINK=0
/IF DIGIT, RETURNS TO RET+1 WITH DIGIT-"0 IN AC AND LINK=1
/IF NEITHER, RETURNS TO RET WITH CHAR-"A IN AC.
