	DCA OUTLIM	/YES, SET UP THE PROPER LOCATIONS
	TAD ALTDF1
	DCA LIMDIF	/TO GET 1 OUTPUT AND 5 INPUT FILES
	TAD ALTDF2
	DCA BEGDIF	/ALL OF WHICH ARE
			/5-WORD <DEVICE,NAME> ENTRIES
	DCA I PLKUPS
	TAD STARJM
	DCA I PSTARS	/AND ALLOW *
			/AS A FILE OR EXTENSION NAME
